# i18n & formatting (ubuteco-react)

See [i18n-and-formatting.md](../../docs/context/i18n-and-formatting.md).

## Rules

- User-visible strings via `t()` — update `en`, `pt-BR`, `es` (and `fr` when touching FR surfaces).
- Money: `useMoneyFormat()` / `formatMoney` — no hardcoded currency.
- Date-only fields (`valid_until`): `_lib/format-date.ts` — avoid TZ shift.
- API error display: `localize-form-errors` + `code` from API.

Org locale/currency/timezone: API is source of truth ([ADR 002](../../../ubuteco_api/docs/decisions/002-org-locale-not-user-locale.md)).
